# Recorded input for the menu example page (widgets/menu.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600 in the
# default theme: the trigger "File" at x 8..58, y 8..42; the open list at x 8..80, y 48..172
# with New (y 51..81), Open (81..110), Recent (110..140) and Quit (140..169), x 11..77; the
# submenu at x 80..161, y 107..172 with Scene 1 (y 110..140) and Scene 2 (140..169), x 83..158.
# One line per frame says what it does (format: input.Replay). Keys are USB HID: 81 Down,
# 79 Right, 41 Escape.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.016
pointer 400 300
# 1: press File
frame
pointer 33 25
buttons left
# 2: release: open, New highlighted
frame
buttons
# 3: the pointer reaches Open
frame
pointer 44 95
# 4: Down: Recent
frame
press 81
# 5: Right: the submenu opens
frame
press 79
# 6: the pointer reaches Scene 2
frame
pointer 120 154
# 7: press it
frame
buttons left
# 8: release: Scene 2 chosen, the menu closes
frame
buttons
# 9: press File
frame
pointer 33 25
buttons left
# 10: release: open
frame
buttons
# 11: the pointer reaches Recent: the submenu opens
frame
pointer 44 125
# 12: Escape: the submenu closes
frame
press 41
# 13: Escape: the menu closes
frame
press 41
